  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.84,
      "text": " Your couples aren't comparing you against every venue, they're comparing you against a shortlist."
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 5.98,
      "end": 12.62,
      "text": " And if you don't understand how you stack up against that competition, you're making marketing decisions in the dark."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 14.36,
      "end": 28.46,
      "text": " Competitor intelligence automatically discovers nearby wedding venues based on your location, venue type and market positioning, from barns and country houses to hotels, estates and exclusive-use venues."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 30.0,
      "end": 32.62,
      "text": " Simply select the venues you want to track."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 33.5,
      "end": 40.2,
      "text": " Studio AI then analyses each competitor using the same scoring framework applied to your own venue."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 41.4,
      "end": 56.86,
      "text": " This creates a like-for-like comparison across the areas that influence enquiry and booking decisions, positioning, pricing, social proof, calls to action, brand strength and overall conversion effectiveness."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 58.14,
      "end": 70.7,
      "text": " Rather than spending hours manually reviewing competitor websites, Studio AI highlights the strengths they promote, the weaknesses they expose and the opportunities they leave behind."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 72.52,
      "end": 81.38,
      "text": " Every finding can be reviewed, confirmed or dismissed, giving you complete control over the final intelligence used within your reports."
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 82.62,
      "end": 94.34,
      "text": " Once competitor analysis is complete, Studio AI produces a clear gap analysis, showing where you're leading, where you're competitive and where you're falling behind."
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 95.7,
      "end": 105.8,
      "text": " More importantly, it explains what to do about it, turning competitive insight into practical recommendations your team can actually implement."
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 107.08,
      "end": 120.96,
      "text": " This isn't about copying other venues, it's about understanding your market, identifying opportunities others have missed and creating a stronger reason for couples to choose you, the intelligence behind every booking."
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 122.2,
      "end": 131.14,
      "text": " Because when you combine website performance, competitive positioning and enquiry conversion data, you start to see the complete picture."
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 133.12,
      "end": 135.76,
      "text": " But seeing the gap is only half the job."
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 136.16,
      "end": 138.4,
      "text": " Closing it is where Convert comes in."
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 138.5,
      "end": 138.5,
      "text": ""
    }
  ]
